      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are seeking a ritual to end the burden you carry, but suicide in the face of a desperate reality will be a shadow of the death you actually caused. The \"honor\" you imagine will feel even crass and cruel to the dead than the pain you continue to endure.",
